\"id\":75612,\"title\":\"Oblivion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eO3r38fwnhb58M1YgcjQBd3VNcp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2kVt8oj1cSz4GAP0Hi8SESOiH0T.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jack Harper is one of the last few drone repairmen stationed on Earth. Part of a massive operation to extract vital resources after decades of war with a terrifying threat known as the Scavs, Jack’s mission is nearly complete. His existence is brought crashing down when he rescues a beautiful  stranger from a downed spacecraft. Her arrival triggers a chain of events that  forces him to question everything he knows and puts the fate of humanity in his hands.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13183,\"title\":\"Watchmen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aVURelN3pM56lFM7Dgfs5TixcIf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dH7ia3vtkYCa3CBvDnvVjqm9uiQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a gritty and alternate 1985, the glory days of costumed vigilantes have been brought to a close by a government crackdown. But after one of the masked veterans is brutally murdered, an investigation into the killer is initiated. The reunited heroes set out to prevent their own destruction, but in doing so they uncover a sinister plot that puts all of humanity in grave danger.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":406990,\"title\":\"What Happened to Monday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/atOgZMJpMrTdpqvPiHVPfBhR61l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7ij93mtHXAF8D3PjRSEaKPHpIE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a world where families are limited to one child due to overpopulation, a set of identical septuplets must avoid being put to a long sleep by the government and dangerous infighting while investigating the disappearance of one of their own.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":615173,\"title\":\"The Witch: Part 2. The Other One\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9YTuscJXmr9Iua62amCgGSU8PDW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iryef4LKiPQkvhNJS1EtLlay3br.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A girl wakes up in a huge secret laboratory, then accidentally meets another girl who is trying to protect her house from a gang. The mystery girl overthrows the gang with her unexpected powers, and laboratory staff set out to find her.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":440471,\"title\":\"Escape Plan 2: Hades\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A6tb8JNrie2qT8JC2tGqshayuck.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xIAaN3AQqaJiN5RJ0WsmBady8Hq.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ray Breslin manages an elite team of security specialists trained in the art of breaking people out of the world's most impenetrable prisons. When his most trusted operative, Shu Ren, is kidnapped and disappears inside the most elaborate prison ever built, Ray must track him down with the help of some of his former friends.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":123025,\"title\":\"Batman: The Dark Knight Returns, Part 1\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rVr2Tdp2LcL3DheXUrVN345Myhg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1YaG52CwGY3pKh76OBlwX0ymncg.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Batman has not been seen for ten years. A new breed of criminal ravages Gotham City, forcing 55-year-old Bruce Wayne back into the cape and cowl. But, does he still have what it takes to fight crime in a new era?\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":19898,\"title\":\"Pandorum\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mNMfa6r3pl0EzFIKEkVcxyr6Rc7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2M5V8VcK02o4R5cxe7Ew1ltaxKr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two crew members wake up on an abandoned spacecraft with no idea who they are, how long they've been asleep, or what their mission is. The two soon discover they're actually not alone – and the reality of their situation is more horrifying than they could have imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8452,\"title\":\"The 6th Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nlbB47qp1oxEtts9Ik3UYAwKWHM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pf5xJlqKLPSCXnyn3KlbAuxcklZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A world of the very near future in which cattle, fish, and even the family pet can be cloned. But cloning humans is illegal - that is until family man Adam Gibson comes home from work one day to find a clone has replaced him. Taken from his family and plunged into a sinister world he doesn't understand, Gibson must not only save himself from the assassins who must destroy him to protect their secret, but uncover who and what is behind the horrible things happening to him.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":757860,\"title\":\"The Yin-Yang Master: Dream of Eternity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/odgDN1po1j7cEVLeBhkVS0Oh4kC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sFxRU341P2iVlXicthm9iMbpFhX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Every few hundred years, the most powerful demon on earth—a snake demon—awakens, and the Yin-Yang Masters are summoned to the capital. Meanwhile, the Princess of the realm has her own plans, as she conspires to claim the demon’s power.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20329,\"title\":\"Death Note: L Change the WorLd\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTV14kh4YVXafBZtyNjQ2GrWsNh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m4qM1XvABr1mVKWKohvHA7obLsY.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\\\"The human whose name is written in the Death Note shall die.\\\" After making the hardest decision ever, another serious case confronts L. There are only 23 days left and without his best partner Watari, L has to solve the case all by himself for the very first time.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1061474,\"title\":\"Superman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ombsmhYUqR4qqOLOxAyr5V8hbyv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eGX66zonvc4bXg3rM08RUxdYSDx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Superman, a journalist in Metropolis, embarks on a journey to reconcile his Kryptonian heritage with his human upbringing as Clark Kent.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"-zYxgTRLIi0\",\"name\":\"Official International Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"CBJAz-y2HDs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"DrNM5QhAr_M\",\"name\":\"메인 예고편 (한국어)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}